# A divisor whose range includes zero though zero is not an instance.
-- source.cue --
d: int & !=0 & >=-5 & <=5
-- target.cue --
q: int
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {q: quo(10, v0_0.d)}
-- out --
unknown
v1_0.q divides by v0_0.d, whose range [-5, 5] includes 0, though 0 may not be an instance; bound the divisor away from 0 (>0 or <0) (rule unknown-divisor) @ lens.cue:2:15
